# Same bytes on every machine: text files are checked out with LF on
# Windows too (Git for Windows would otherwise turn them into CRLF), so a
# Mac and a PC build of one commit compile identical sources and manifests
# (netplay between them needs the same game; docs/WINDOWS_AND_LAN.md).
* text=auto eol=lf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
# cmd.exe needs CRLF: windows/Setup.bat and Play.bat (the players' ZIP).
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.ico binary
*.png binary
*.tga binary
